\n\n$$\\oint_C P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y=-\\oint_C y\\,\\text{d}x.$$\n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is\n\n$$r'(t)=\\langle -7\\sin t,3\\cos t\\rangle.$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our line integral as\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}-\\oint_C y\\,\\text{d}x&=-\\int_0^{2\\pi}3\\sin t\\cdot(-7\\sin t)\\,\\text{d}t\\\\&=21\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\sin^2 t\\,\\text{d}t\\\\&=21\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{1-\\cos 2t}{2}\\,\\text{d}t\\\\&=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\left(\\frac{21}{2}-\\frac{21}{2}\\cos 2t\\right)\\,\\text{d}t\\\\&=\\left[\\frac{21}{2}t-\\frac{21}{4}\\sin 2t\\right]_0^{2\\pi}\\\\&=\\left(21 \\pi-0\\right)-\\left(0-0\\right)\\\\&=21 \\pi\\end{aligned}$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $\\text{Area}(D)=21 \\pi.$" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540278 1080 "\\frac{42}{5}" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540278 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540278 1083 #uuid "09abfe12-73cb-58a7-8f06-0ec5d416c06d" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540279 1080 "6 \\pi" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540279 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540279 1083 #uuid "263ffce1-698e-508e-8873-25171957ad4d" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540280 1080 "8 \\pi" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540280 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540280 1083 #uuid "2653811b-6a3f-50e5-80be-c5b24fcbaf1a" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540281 1080 "96 \\pi" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540281 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540281 1083 #uuid "368712d0-119f-5f7e-9dcf-f27b8a9ce142" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540282 1080 "6 \\pi" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540282 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540282 1083 #uuid "3839d780-0e6c-5d0e-9f8e-06c50df07c5e" 13194139535909 17592186045443 true] [17592186540283 1